        skos:exactMatch  obo:CHEBI_9673;
        skos:note        "An <em>N</em>-sulfonylurea that is <em>N</em>-[<em>o</em>-(2-chloroethoxy)phenyl]sulfonylurea in which one of the hydrogens attached to the non-sulfonylated nitrogen has been replaced by a 4-methoxy-6-methyl-1,3,5-triazin-2-yl group. A herbicide used to control broad-leaved weeds in cereals, its use within the EU has been banned after September 2017 on the grounds of potential groundwater contamination and risks to aquatic life."@en .

